Dear Tom,

It was a pleasure to meet you at the trade fair in S=C3=A3o Paulo last mont=
h. As we discussed, Rio Bombas would like to become Kestrel's exclusive dis=
tributor for Brazil.

Please find attached our draft distribution agreement. The key points are:
- exclusive rights for the whole of Brazil, including sales to OEMs, EPC co=
ntractors and the state water and sanitation companies;
- minimum purchase targets of EUR 400,000 in the first year, rising to EUR =
900,000 in the third year;
- an initial term of five years;
- Brazilian law, with the courts of S=C3=A3o Paulo.

We would be grateful for your comments by 13 November, so that we can sign =
before the end of the year and start marketing in January.

Atenciosamente / Kind regards,

Carlos Mendes
Diretor Comercial / Commercial Director
Rio Bombas Distribui=C3=A7=C3=A3o Ltda
S=C3=A3o Paulo, SP, Brasil
T +55 11 0123 4567

