<p>Dear Tom,</p>
<p>It was a pleasure to meet you at the trade fair in S=C3=A3o Paulo last m=
onth.
As we discussed, Rio Bombas would like to become Kestrel's exclusive
distributor for Brazil.</p>
<p>Please find attached our draft distribution agreement. The key points
are:<br>
- exclusive rights for the whole of Brazil, including sales to OEMs, EPC
contractors and the state water and sanitation companies;<br>
- minimum purchase targets of EUR 400,000 in the first year, rising to EUR
900,000 in the third year;<br>
- an initial term of five years;<br>
- Brazilian law, with the courts of S=C3=A3o Paulo.</p>
<p>We would be grateful for your comments by 13 November, so that we can
sign before the end of the year and start marketing in January.</p>
<p>Atenciosamente / Kind regards,</p>
<p>Carlos Mendes<br>
Diretor Comercial / Commercial Director<br>
Rio Bombas Distribui=C3=A7=C3=A3o Ltda<br>
S=C3=A3o Paulo, SP, Brasil<br>
T +55 11 0123 4567</p>
</body>
</html>

